## Areas we target

Newport city centre, Cwmbran, Caerleon, Chepstow, Pontypool, Abergavenny, and across Gwent.

## Frequently asked questions

**How is local SEO different from general SEO?**

Local SEO focuses on appearing in searches made by people in your geographic area — including Google Maps results and "near me" searches.

**How long does it take?** Typically 3–6 months for meaningful results.
